        <strong>Private Tuition:</strong> Cohen's d = {s['effects'][1]['cohens_d']:.3f} (negligible). The mean gap is {s['effects'][1]['diff_or_eta']:.3f} GPA points. Tuition appears to offer limited marginal benefit at the population level.
      </div>
    </div>

